---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Compare AI agent GitHub repositories" description="Compare two public AI agent repositories by freshness, health, documentation, stack and static risk indicators.">
<main class="compare-page"><header><span>COMPARE / PUBLIC EVIDENCE</span><h1>Two agents.<br/><em>One decision.</em></h1><p>Paste two public GitHub repositories and PARADOX will score the same evidence for both.</p></header><form id="compareForm"><input id="repoA" type="url" placeholder="First GitHub URL" required/><input id="repoB" type="url" placeholder="Second GitHub URL" required/><button>COMPARE ↗</button></form><div id="compareStatus" class="status"></div><section id="compareResult" class="compare-result" hidden></section></main>
<script type="module" src="/scripts/compare.js"></script>
<style>.compare-page{padding:80px clamp(20px,7vw,110px);background:#f2efe7;min-height:90svh}.compare-page header>span{font:9px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.16em;color:#ff5a3d}.compare-page h1{font:700 clamp(70px,11vw,155px)/.78 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.09em;margin:28px 0}.compare-page h1 em{font-family:'Instrument Serif';font-weight:400;color:#ff5a3d}.compare-page header p{color:#686a63;font-size:17px}.compare-page form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:10px;margin:35px 0}.compare-page input{padding:16px;border:1px solid #aaa79e;background:#fff;font:12px 'DM Mono'}.compare-page form button{padding:16px;background:#0d0e0e;color:#fff;border:0;font:9px 'DM Mono'}.status{min-height:22px;font:10px 'DM Mono';color:#ff5a3d}.compare-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.compare-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #c3c0b7;padding:25px}.compare-card.winner{outline:3px solid #d9ff3f}.compare-card h2{font:400 38px/.95 'Instrument Serif'}.score{font:700 64px 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.08em}.compare-card ul{padding-left:18px;color:#676960;line-height:1.8}.badge{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#ff5a3d}@media(max-width:800px){.compare-page form,.compare-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</BaseLayout>
